    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kabonk! is a nostalgic brick-breaker with multilevel puzzles, physic based controls and a sweet set of power ups set in neon-lit arcades. Enter the arcade and experience a classic with sparks, bounces and bonks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kabonk! you control a physics based paddle and navigate through multiple arcade levels by breaking bricks with different types of spheres, each with unique physics-based properties. Try smashing difficult bricks with more force or add spin-effects to reach difficult objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some bricks are unbreakable but some just needs some force or extra love. Manipulate your way through each level and try to beat each puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-lit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switches, buttons and pressure plates</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kabonk! is a nostalgic brick-breaker with multilevel puzzles, physic based controls and a sweet set of power ups set in neon-lit arcades. Enter the arcade and experience a classic with sparks, bounces and bonks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kabonk! you control a physics based paddle and navigate through multiple arcade levels by breaking bricks with different types of spheres, each with unique physics-based properties. Try smashing difficult bricks with more force or add spin-effects to reach difficult objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.poster.avif?t=1755089455\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.webm?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.mp4?t=1755089455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some bricks are unbreakable but some just needs some force or extra love. Manipulate your way through each level and try to beat each puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-lit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switches, buttons and pressure plates</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into neon-lit arcades and break, blast, and push your way through bricks and obstacles in this nostalgic brick-breaking classic. Use physics, trick-shots, and power-ups in your advance to beat challenging levels and rack up high scores.",
